font-size: 16px; margin-top: 5px;\">{{ $json.company_name }}</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"metric-label\">Report ID</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px; font-family: monospace;\">{{ $json.report_id }}</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n        <a href=\"{{ $json.google_doc_url }}\" class=\"cta-button\">📄 View Full Report</a>\n      </div>\n      \n      <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><strong>What's in your report:</strong></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Executive Summary with key findings</li>\n        <li>Market Comparison across 6 signals</li>\n        <li>Cross-validated insights from 5 agents</li>\n        <li>Top 3 decision factors with recommendations</li>\n        <li>Risk/Opportunity matrix</li>\n        <li>30-day and 90-day action plans</li>\n        <li>Confidence scoring with HHH methodology</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <p style=\"border-left: 4px solid #667eea; padding-left: 15px; margin: 20px 0; font-style: italic;\">\n        💡 Pro tip: Use the AI Chat Assistant to ask follow-up questions about your report and dive deeper into specific sections.\n      </p>\n      \n      <p>Questions? Reply to this email or reach out to our support team.</p>\n      \n      <p>Best regards,<br>\n      <strong>The StratAI Team</strong></p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>© 2025 StratAI - Strategic Intelligence Platform<br>\n      Generated on {{ $json.timestamp }}</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
